{
    "id": "webview-adblock@beatlink",
    "name": "Web View Adblock",
    "description": "Ad and tracker blocking for Trilium Desktop's built-in Web View note type. Cancels ad requests with an EasyList/EasyPrivacy filter on the webview's Electron session, and injects EasyList's element-hiding rules into each page to collapse the ad slots that DNS-level blockers can't touch.",
